msgid "Video Blogger"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Video Blogger" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a video blogger, creating and commenting video content and then "
"posting it on various platforms.  Now most of your fans are dead, alongside "
"your equipment.  Maybe leading a fanbase, moderating myriads of comments and"
" surviving shitstorms has taught you something valuable after all."
msgstr ""

