#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "소총수"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought that it would happen like this."
msgstr "당신이 어렸을 때, 당신은 군인이 되길 꿈꿨습니다. 전쟁은 지옥이고 지옥이 전쟁입니다만 이런 일이 벌어질 줄은 몰랐네요."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "소총수"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
