msgid ""
"Your days of patrolling the park and protecting people and wildlife from "
"each other have taught you many useful skills.  After finding a gruesome "
"scene at a campsite and no response when you radioed for help, you "
"stockpiled as many supplies as possible and set out in your pickup looking "
"for answers."
