#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "bridge pavement"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "bridge yellow pavement"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "bridge sidewalk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-bridges-docks.json
