#. ~ Description of "pair of thermal electric gloves"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is a pair of gloves with internal battery-powered heating elements.  "
"Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "배터리로 작동되는 발열장치가 내장된 장갑. 사용하면 전원이 켜집니다."

