#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 40gr unjacketed bullet.  The .22LR round is"
" extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  It is most useful "
"for target practice and hunting small animals.  Someone was down on their "
"luck when they hand-reloaded this one - it's filled with black powder "
"instead of smokeless powder.  Expect lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a "
"dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""

