msgid_plural ""
"copies of Chemistry for Kids: Awesome Science Experiments that Really Work"
msgstr[0] "아이들을 위한 화학: 실제로 작동하는 멋진 과학 실험들"

#. ~ Description of "Chemistry for Kids: Awesome Science Experiments that
#. Really Work"
#: data/json/items/book/chemistry.json
