msgstr[0] "바이오디젤: 재생식 연료 자원"

#. ~ Description of "Biodiesel: Renewable Fuel Resource"
#: data/json/items/book/chemistry.json
msgid "A large textbook for college students about biodiesel."
msgstr "바이오디젤에 관해 적힌 두꺼운 전공서적입니다."

#. ~ Item name
