#. a serious price modifier for non-Cannibals.
#. ~ Description of "To Serve Man"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "It's… it's a cookbook!"
msgstr "이… 이건 요리책입니다!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
