msgid_plural "copies of Drink the Harvest"
msgstr[0] "수확물 마시기"

#. ~ Later on add mead transforms that don't require distilling to this book
#. that match the source book. Possibly wait til beekeeping is added.
#. ~ Description of "Drink the Harvest"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Canning foods doesn't have to stop with jam and pickles.  This book provides"
" a plethora of juices that can be preserved."
msgstr "통조림을 만들 때 잼과 피클만으로 만족할 필요는 없습니다. 이 책은 지나치게 많이 만든 주스를 보존하는 방법을 제공합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
