msgid_plural "copies of The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "총기 소지자를 위한 안내서"

#. ~ Description of "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid ""
"A thick soft-cover book that claims to be a complete guide to safely "
