msgstr "달달한 발효 유제품. 훌륭한 먹거리다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "curdled milk"
msgid_plural "curdled milks"
msgstr[0] "응고된 우유"

#. ~ Description of "curdled milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Milk that has been curdled with vinegar and rennet.  It still needs to be "
"salted and drained of whey."
msgstr "식초와 레닛을 넣어 응고시킨 우유. 치즈가 되려면 소금을 치고 유청을 제거해야 합니다."

