"For a moment your hand seems to get stuck in something.  You look around, "
"but you can't find what it was."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid "For a split second, your hand seems to disappear in the air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MESSAGES_DEX_BAD"
#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
msgid ""
"Your right hand suddenly trespasses your left hand.  You separate them "
