"This hardcover book, aimed at the gun nut, provides an illustrated, concise "
"history of the handgun throughout history, including technical "
"specifications and use techniques.  It's difficult to follow without a "
"passing knowledge in pistols, but an experienced handgun user could glean "
"much from it."
msgstr ""

