#. ~ Description of gun "W1011 Silvergram"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A finely sculpted white and silver pistol entrusted to Wraitheon's corporate"
" elite.  It employs advanced targeting and precision guiding capabilities to"
" deliver devastating bursts of guided 10mm microjet darts.  Firing is as "
"expensive as it looks."
msgstr ""

