#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
