#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/monsterspells.json
msgid "A trap that summons forge hounds!  Not what you were expecting, is it?"
msgstr "포지 하운드를 소환하는 함정입니다!  이건 예상치 못했겠죠?"

#. ~ Spell name
