msgid "black dragon scale"
msgid_plural "black dragon scales"
msgstr[0] "블랙 드래곤 비늘"

#. ~ Description of "black dragon scale"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A scale from a black dragon.  It still has its magical properties and acid "
"resistance."
msgstr "검은 용의 비늘입니다. 여전히 마법적인 성질과 내산성을 띠고 있습니다."

#. ~ inspiration from bundle of planks
