#. ~ Description of "kampuch"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/herbs_and_flowers.json
msgid ""
"A small rod of curled white petals, delicately shielding toxic pollen that "
"will lead to an agonizing, if mercifully quick death.  Infamously used by "
"romantic assassins, when an artistic death is deemed more important than "
"practicality."
msgstr ""

#. ~ armor' and 'summon' related
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/herbs_and_flowers.json
