#. ~ Description of "olieribos sheaf"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/herbs_and_flowers.json
msgid ""
"Dark colored leaves and bitter roots, firmly tied together in a small sheaf."
"  It's not toxic, but a lot of people died, trying to taste it, due to the "
"airway obstruction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ 'light' related, partially 'speed'
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/herbs_and_flowers.json
msgid "glowing mushroom caps"
msgid_plural "glowing mushroom caps"
msgstr[0] ""

