#. ~ Description of MOD "Xedra Evolved"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"A content mod for Agent Mulder in the apocalypse.  Imagines what if Xedra "
"had more time before the Cataclysm occurred.  Contains monsters of various "
"types, new professions and locations, new uses for existing skills plus the "
"new deduction skill, new magic systems, and content of every type that a "
"multidimensional Cataclysm has to offer.  This is a heavily science fantasy "
"mod where you are as likely to encounter supernatural monsters, as you are "
"to encounter UFOs and Sasquatch and Chupacabra."
